1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,810
Your toast lands butter-side down...

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,130
and a physicist proved it's your table's

3
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:04,830
fault.

4
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,540
Toast sliding off a table doesn't fall

5
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:08,700
flat. It tips at the edge and starts

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,450
to spin.

7
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,350
From a normal table, there's only time for

8
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,420
about half a turn.

9
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,700
And half a turn flips the buttered side

10
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,510
to the bottom.

11
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,710
To land butter-up, you'd need a table

12
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:19,230
about three meters tall.

13
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,630
Or push it off fast.

14
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,870
So... how tall is your table?
